 \n_________________________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (92.57654pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3169--3171\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/it/10.95 Answer: \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n/10.95 \n_________________________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (92.57654pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3178--3180\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/it/10.95 Answer: \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n/10.95 \n_________________________________________________________ \n[42] [43] [44]\nOverfull \\hbox (2.56209pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3421--3423\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n/10.95 _______________ 2. _______________ 3. _____\n__________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (45.03394pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3434--3437\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/b/n/10.95 S (Specific): \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n/1\n0.95 ________________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (63.37517pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3437--3440\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/b/n/10.95 M (Measurable): \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n\n/10.95 _______________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (48.32988pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3440--3443\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/b/n/10.95 A (Achievable): \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n\n/10.95 ______________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (64.13072pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3446--3448\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/b/n/10.95 T (Time-bound): \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n\n/10.95 _______________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (11.85321pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3467--3470\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n/10.95 For small steps: __________________________\n_________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (50.13431pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3494--3496\n[]\\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/it/10.95 Strategy: \\TU/LatinModernRoman(0)/m/n/10.9\n5 _________________________________________________ \n\nOverfull \\hbox (50.13431pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 3504--3506\n[]\\TU